## Ship it: Astro to Webflow Cloud

Loading Today is built from Webflow’s official [astro-gsap starter](https://github.com/Webflow-Examples/astro-gsap), which already includes the Astro, GSAP, and Cloudflare setup. PixiJS and Matter load only when they’re needed, the few server-side features use Astro API routes, and Webflow Cloud handles the build and deployment whenever I push to the repo.

* * *

If this gives you an idea for the [CodeTV hackathon](https://codetv-gsap-cloud.webflow.io/?ref=okaydev.co), I’d love to see what you make. You can also find me and plenty of other people building web experiments on [OKAYDEV](https://okaydev.co/?ref=okaydev.co).

